==Trivia==
* Rinka and Kenichi are named and designed after their Japanese voice actors, Rinka Ōtani and [[Hyadain]] (whose real name is Kenichi Maeyamada), who are two of the co-hosts of ''[[Meet Up at the Pokémon House?]]''.<ref>[https://www.tv-tokyo.co.jp/anime/pokemon_sunmoon/news/index.html#214189 「ポケモンの家あつまる？」から豪華キャストが続々出演！]</ref>
** Rinka's design is specifically modeled after her first-ever outfit on Pokénchi.
* Closed captions for the English [[dub]] refer to them as '''female staff member''' and '''male staff member'''‬.

